<title>FINLAND: BIG IN-HOUSE DEAL IN SUUNTO.</title>
<headline>BIG IN-HOUSE DEAL IN SUUNTO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A large in-house deal in compass maker Suunto Oy was traded by Arctos Securities on Thursday.</p>
<p>Arctos traded in-house 1,750,000 Suunto shares at 58.00 markka per share, up three markka. The brokerage declined comment on the deal.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
